     <SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 22pt; FONT-FAMILY: 方正小标宋简体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28.7pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" align=center><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 22pt; FONT-FAMILY: 方正小标宋简体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>关于转发团绍联[2019]13号文件“绍兴市大中学生暑期社会实践活动”相关内容的通知</SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28.7pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28.7pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>（新）高一、高二各班：</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-left: .76gd; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>《关于组织开展2019年绍兴市大中学生“新青年下乡”暑期社会实践活动的通知》（团绍联[2019]13号，下附）于今日刚刚下发，请结合其中中学生实践内容，并结合我校前日所发的《关于开展2019暑期社会实践活动的通知》（6月27日校网通知 <A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/[InstallDir_ChannelDir]ShowArticle.asp?ArticleID=15458">/Article/ShowArticle.asp?ArticleID=15458</A>），在暑期有重点、有统筹地开展社会实践，以下涉及的活动项目类别中，各班团支部<B>至少开展两类</B>。。</SPAN></P><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>
<P class=MsoBodyTextIndent style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-top: 0cm; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>开学后报送材料要求：</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: 黑体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>（一）材料内容包括：活动计划，活动过程，活动照片，活动感悟，成果与社会评价，<B>宣传报道记录</B>等，同时，<U>鼓励各小队、支部以视频形式记录活动过程</U>。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>（二）提交办法：将上述材料<B>电子版</B>提交至公共文件夹“团委</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"> <SPAN lang=EN-US>- </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>社会实践志愿服务</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"> <SPAN lang=EN-US>- 2019</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>暑期社会实践”，以班级团支部为单位建立文件夹（命名为新班级编号，如</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">201</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>），</SPAN><B><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: red; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>请勿提交压缩包</SPAN></B><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>，<B>照片请<U>将高清原图单独以编号命名放在文件夹内</U>，同时插入到文档中</B>。截止时间：</SPAN><B><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: red; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">9</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: red; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>月3</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: red; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>日（较之前有调整）</SPAN></B><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>（三）个人实践活动记录表：请<B>现高一</B>的各班班主任</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">/</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>社会实践学分认定员，将学分认定表发还给各位同学，请同学们<B>妥善保管</B>，于高二开学初重新交给新班级的班主任</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">/</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>认定员保管。本次暑期社会实践，请每位同学认真填写</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>实践活动记录表（将发纸质版，如不够，可自行打印），开学后进行学分认定工作</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt'>。</SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt'>注1：开学后两周内将开展社会实践的交流考核、评奖表彰活动，请各班团支部提前做好准备。</SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-size: 14.0pt'>注2：鼓励、提倡学生在高一、高二期间完成三年总量不超过8学分的社会实践（志愿服务）类选修课程，每一学期（含寒暑假）每人不超过3学分，其中，每个寒暑假每人不超过2学分，高中期间每人参加同一社会实践活动（相同单位组织、相同内容）最高不超过3学分。</SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-left: .76gd; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5">【以新班级为单位组织开展，社会实践表也将以新班级为单位发放。】</SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-left: .76gd; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5" align=right><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>校团委<BR>2019年7月3日</SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-left: .76gd; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'></SPAN> </P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-left: .76gd; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'></SPAN> </P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-left: .76gd; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><附文件></SPAN></P><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 22pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: major-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-fareast">关于组织开展<SPAN lang=EN-US>2019</SPAN>年绍兴市大中学生“新青年下乡”暑期社会实践活动的通知</SPAN></B><B><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 22pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: major-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-fareast"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">各区、县（市）宣传部、团委、教育（体育）局</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">各在绍高校：<SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">    </SPAN><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">为深入学习宣传贯彻习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想，贯彻落实习近平总书记在学校思想政治理论课教师座谈会上的重要讲话精神，引领广大青年学生在切实感受新中国成立70周年取得的巨大成就中受教育、长才干、作贡献</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">经市委宣传部、团市委、市教育局、市学联研究决定，组织开展2019年绍兴市大中学生“新青年下乡”暑期社会实践活动（以下简称“暑期社会实践活动”）。相关事宜通知如下：<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>一、活动主题</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 黑体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">青春心向党·建功新时代<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>二、活动重点方向指引</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 黑体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">以新中国成立70周年为契机</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">紧紧围绕团市委“新青年下乡”“新青年·学思政”等活动部署要求，主动融入“三服务”、乡村振兴等中心工作，以实际行动推动新时代绍兴高质量发展。<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 楷体_GB2312">（一）专项团队<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">1.理论普及宣讲团。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">重点围绕学习宣传贯彻习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想和党的十九大、十九届二中、三中全会精神，大力弘扬红船精神，开展宣讲报告、学习座谈等形式的社会实践。<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">2.历史成就观察团。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">重点围绕中华人民共和国成立70年来的历史性成就，通过开展参观考察、国情调研等形式的实地观察学习活动，充分把握和理解国家深化改革的政策举措，积极为国家和家乡重大发展战略建言献策。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">3.依法治国宣讲团。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">重点围绕“七五”普法规划，围绕平安绍兴、法治绍兴、清廉绍兴建设和反邪教、禁毒宣传，开展法律法规宣讲、法治成果展示等形式的社会实践活动。<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">4.科技支农帮扶团。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">重点围绕乡村振兴，开展农技培训推广、农业科普讲座、金融知识下乡、乡风文明宣传等形式的社会实践活动。<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">5.教育关爱服务团。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">通过学业辅导、亲情陪伴、自护教育、素质拓展等形式，重点开展针对农村未成年人和留守儿童的精准关爱志愿服务活动，积极参与东西部扶贫协作。<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">6.文化艺术服务团。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">重点围绕培育和践行社会主义核心价值观，参与农村文化礼堂、社区文化家园建设，开展艺术创作、惠民展演、全民阅读、文化传承普及等社会实践活动。<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">7.爱心医疗服务团。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">重点围绕健康中国战略，开展健康普查、巡回医疗、流行性疾病防治、基本医疗卫生知识普及、乡村医疗站点服务、保护视力和防艾宣传等形式的社会实践活动。<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">8.美丽绍兴实践团。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">重点围绕打好污染防治攻坚战，开展环境治理、科普宣讲、社会调研、发展献策等活动。鼓励学生积极参与长江经济带共抓大保护，引导广大学生争当“河小二”开展护水巡河活动，讲好美丽绍兴故事。<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 楷体_GB2312">（二）重点方向<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">1.“习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想”宣讲交流活动。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">组织一批习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想宣讲团，深入企业、社区、农村大礼堂等群众密集的场所，广泛开展小规模、互动式、有特色、接地气的面对面宣讲交流，广泛开展各类爱国主题实践教育活动，拓展大中学思政课堂的内容延伸。<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">2.“寻访绍兴革命先烈共温风雨历程”青年红色筑梦教育专项活动。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">通过访谈调研、史料整理等方式，挖掘一批为争取民族独立、实现国家富强英勇献身的绍兴籍英烈光辉事迹，形成实践报告、访谈名录等实践成果，在“绍兴青年”公众号“新青年·学思政”专栏等平台发布。<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">3.“青年观察家”中华人民共和国成立70周年专项调研活动。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">聚焦建国70年以来绍兴发展的重大事件、主要成就、重要地点、重点区域，开展参观考察、国情社情调研、专项走访，通过向书本学、向实践学、向群众学等多个渠道，在社会实践中切实感受绍兴城市发展和祖国发展变化。<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">4.“青春助力乡村振兴战略实施”社会实践活动。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">以青春助力“乡村振兴”为导向，走进绍兴基层农村，通过走访调研、乡村文献收集等形式，切实感受“五星3A”带来的乡村风貌变化，每所在绍高校至少组建1支乡村振兴社会实践团队。<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">5.“家燕归巢”大学生留绍实习社会实践活动。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">为“家燕归巢”大学生提供留绍回乡实习岗位和政策，鼓励大学生到机关、企事业单位实习，通过形式多样的实习见习活动服务基层、服务社会。<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">6.“青春助力三服务”社会实践活动。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">围绕“服务企业服务群众服务基层”的要求，走进绍兴本地企业、特色产业园区等群众聚集地，通过调研报告、政策咨询等形式深入调研企业、群众、基层反映的困难和问题。<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">7.“青春助力最多跑一次”社会实践活动。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">围绕深化“最多跑一次”改革，通过走访行政服务审批中心、便民服务中心、“青年文明号”等单位，调研“最多跑一次”改革成效和政府治理创新成果，形成内容详实、客观准确的调研报告。<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">8</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">.“我爱祖国 同唱国歌”实践服务专项活动。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">结合升旗仪式、重大庆典和纪念活动，开展中学生学唱国歌教育实践活动，深入开展国旗法、国歌法、国徽法宣传教育，走访烈士陵园、革命遗址等爱国主义教育基地。</SPAN><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 楷体_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">9</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">.“助力美丽绍兴建设”实践服务专项活动。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">动员中学生走进绍兴的社区、乡镇农村、工矿企业等，围绕“五水共治”、应对气候变化、推进绿色发展等主题，开展环保科普宣传、社会调查研究、生态文化寻访等活动，助力建设美丽绍兴。<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">10</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">.“彩虹人生”中职学生实践服务专项活动。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">面向中职学生开展关爱留守儿童、敬老助残、社区服务、公益宣传等形式的社会实践，鼓励中职学生利用所学知识，积极开展垃圾分类、“光盘行动”、废品回收利用、节能减排、工艺创新等活动。<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=left><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>三、优秀团队、个人名额分配</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 黑体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">根据团省委安排，2019年暑期社会实践中学省级重点团队由各区、县（市）按名额分配择优上报（见附件</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">）。<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">各团区、县（市）委，市属学校推荐市级优秀组织奖4个、优秀团队6支、优秀个人8名，市属学校由市教育局团工委统一上报；各在绍高校团委直接向团市委申报优秀组织奖</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">个</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">及其他各类优秀名单（见附件</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">2</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">）。<o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>四、工作要求</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 黑体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoPlainText style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT face=宋体><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">1.精心组织，突出育人实效。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">要高度重视暑期社会实践活动的组织开展，把它作为加强大中学生思想政治教育、深化爱国主义教育的重要途径，充分发挥社会实践的育人作用，不断扩大工作覆盖和教育实效。<o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">2.注重总结，开展成果展示。</SPAN></B><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN'>要在实践结束后以主题团日活动、汇报路演、分享报告会等多种形式进行集中展示、分享实践感悟，推广优秀典型事迹，以优秀事迹和先进人物影响青年学生，提升社会实践优秀成果影响力。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoPlainText style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT face=宋体><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">3.积极推广，加强品牌建设。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">要协调新闻媒体开辟专题、专栏，充分利用微博、微信、抖音等各类媒体平台，加强优秀个人和事迹的宣传报道，组织各团队根据实践进度发布活动情况，为活动营造良好的舆论氛围。<o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoPlainText style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT face=宋体><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">4.科学管理，确保安全实效。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ansi-language: ZH-CN">要在活动组织实施中加强安全教育和保障，做好前期调研和出发准备，确保学生人身和财产安全，特别是要做好自然灾害和突发事件的应对预案。<o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-left: .76gd; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5"> </P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-left: .76gd; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5"></SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'></SPAN> </P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-left: .76gd; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'><附前一则通知></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28.7pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" align=center>关于开展2019暑期社会实践活动的通知</SPAN><B><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 22pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 方正小标宋简体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28.7pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28.7pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>（新）高一、高二各班：</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-left: .76gd; mso-char-indent-count: 1.5"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>今年市区中小学生暑期社区实践活动时间为</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">7</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>月</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">5</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>日—</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">8</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>月</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">25</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>日，根据绍兴市越城区社区教育委员会、绍兴市教育局、绍兴市关心下一代工作委员会的工作意见，结合我校实际，将具体要求通知如下。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>一、活动主题</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: 黑体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>“喜迎祖国七十华诞，争做新时代好少年”</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>紧紧围绕庆祝中华人民共和国成立</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">70</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>周年这一主线，充分运用青少年喜闻乐见的方式，讲好中国故事、中国共产党故事、新时代中国特色社会主义故事、改革开放故事，着力深化党史国史、红色基因教育，听党话、跟党走，争做新时代好少年，以实际行动为伟大祖国</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">70</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>华诞献礼，过一个充实而有意义的暑假。</SPAN><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: 黑体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>二、活动内容</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: 黑体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>（一）开展“奋进新时代·祖国在我心”系列活动</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 楷体_GB2312"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>从</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">1949</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>年到</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">2019</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>年的</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">70</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>年间，新中国取得了举世瞩目的成就，民族独立、国家富强、百姓安居乐业。回望过去，中华民族从站起来、富起来到强起来，经历了伟大的发展变革。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: 31.2pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>充分利用我市爱国主义教育基地、名人教育资源丰富的优势，组织开展<B>探访红色精神、寻访红色足迹、重访红色之路</B>等活动，通过<B>参观、访问调查、摄影绘画</B>等形式，了解中华民族从站起来、富起来到强起来的伟大飞跃，中国特色社会主义从创立、发展到完善的伟大飞跃，中国人民从温饱不足到小康富裕的伟大飞跃。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: 31.2pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>创设形式多样的活动载体，以“腾飞中国</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"> </SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>辉煌</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">70</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>年”为主题，组织并参与<B>演讲、征文、小报评选、<SPAN style="COLOR: black">唱红歌、读红书、讲革命故事、看红色影视作品、写活动感受</SPAN></B><SPAN style="COLOR: black">等活动，同时，</SPAN>利用<B>好老干部、老战士、老专家、老教师、老模范</B>等“五老”资源，<B>进社区、进学校，讲“红船精神”，讲红色基因，讲党和国家发展史，讲新中国成立</B></SPAN><B><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"> 70 </SPAN></B><B><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>周年的伟大成就</SPAN></B><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>，培养爱党爱国情怀。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>（二）开展“奋进新时代</SPAN></B><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 方正仿宋简体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-size: 17.0pt'>·</SPAN><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>文明伴我行”系列活动</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 楷体_GB2312"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt'>青少年是城市的主人，要引导学生从小事做起，从自身做起，主动践行公民基本道德规范和市民文明公约，讲文明语言，行文明礼仪，养文明习惯，树文明形象。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt'>倡导文明出行，遵守交通规则，</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>收看安全警示教育片，开展“文明过马路”<SPAN style="COLOR: black">“骑乘电瓶车佩戴头盔”等</SPAN><B>文明出行宣传教育活动</B>，增强文明出行、安全出行意识</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt'>。</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>深入开展<B>普法宣传</B>，动员法律、心理、教育等方面“五老”专家或相关部门，生动形象地宣传与中小学生日常生活相关的法律知识。深入镇（街道）、村（社区）开展<B>法律法规、食品卫生、禁毒禁赌、文明礼仪宣传等志愿服务活动</B>。要切实加强交通安全、食品卫生、传染病防治和心理健康等方面自我保护意识。尤其要加强对<B>游泳、防溺水、预防中暑等知识和有关技能的教育</B>，提高自我防护能力。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>（三）开展“奋进新时代</SPAN></B><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 方正仿宋简体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-size: 17.0pt'>·</SPAN><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>劳动实践行”系列活动</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 楷体_GB2312"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>生产劳动是人类社会赖以生存和发展的基础，是人类最基本的实践活动。树立正确的劳动观念，养成劳动的习惯，形成以劳动为荣，以懒惰为耻的品质。</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体'>积极组织、参加劳动体验，通过学做家务劳动，参加</SPAN><B><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>社区卫生保洁和绿化美化</SPAN></B><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>等</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体'>社会公益活动</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>，进行<B>农业生产、工业体验、商业和服务业实习</B>等劳动实践，明白“生活靠劳动创造，人生也靠劳动创造”的道理，</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体'>培养尊重劳动人民和珍惜劳动成果的思想感情，自觉</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>抵制好逸恶劳、贪图享受、不劳而获、奢侈浪费等恶习。高中生重在“践行”，围绕<B>生涯规划</B>，通过<B>访谈、社会小调查、小课题研究</B>等途径，引导学生关注社会，规划未来人生，培育历史使命感和社会责任感，为实现中华民族伟大复兴的中国梦而努力奋斗。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>三、活动要求</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 黑体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>（一）精心部署，</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-size: 17.0pt'>抓好落实</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 楷体_GB2312"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>以新班级为单位，分小队或集体开展，提前制定详尽的实践活动计划，扎实组织开展实践活动。</SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: 31.5pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><B><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体'>（二）</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-size: 17.0pt'>讲求实效，</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial'>强化保障</SPAN></B><B><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: 31.5pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>提高实际</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial'>参与率，由</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt'>教师（班主任）指导学生开展好</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>社会实践活动。</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold'>加强</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt'>诚信教育，</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>根据学生参加社会实践活动的时间量、内容、态度、成效等加以评价，纳入开学后的社会实践评比及学生综合素质的评价指标体系。要求</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>创新教育方式，创新活动内容，</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial'>创新活动载体，</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; LETTER-SPACING: -0.3pt; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>组织开展好各项活动</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-size: 17.0pt'>。</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体'>同时要加强学生安全教育，确保活动安全。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">     </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 17.0pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>（三）资源整合，加强宣传</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 楷体_GB2312"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>从实际出发，跳出传统模式，注重创新，精心设计活动，形成内容丰富的活动菜单，由学生自主选择。</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt'>充分利用电台、电视台、网站、报刊、微信公众号等新闻媒体和社区（村）宣传阵地，及时报道暑期实践活动的开展情况和先进事迹，并做好记录存档。</SPAN><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 楷体_GB2312"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>四、总结表彰</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: 黑体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoBodyTextIndent style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-top: 0cm; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>（一）班级团支部做好小队和支部的活动总结，并对全体同学进行活动的观察、考核，推荐表现突出者为校级社会实先进个人，学校将对在暑期社会实践中有突出贡献的同学进行表彰，并组织交流考核，评选出团体一、二等奖，并从团体、个人中择优上报参与市区先进评比。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoBodyTextIndent style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-top: 0cm; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-margin-left: 0gd; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>（二）市区为有效激励各单位组织学生暑期社区（社会）实践活动，在暑期活动结束后，对市区中小学生暑期社区（社会）实践活动情况开展考核评比，并对涌现出来的先进集体、先进个人、优秀实践小队和实践之星进行表彰。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
    
